Muse Passport

This community project contains code derived from Muse Gadget SDK.
Upstream: https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
Upstream base checked out locally: b9008ab.

Community additions and integration changes include the Android BLE/network
companion, the iOS companion, FoloToy AI Passport board support, Chinese UI,
audio transport, text paging, and runtime SDK token configuration. The iOS
companion's Noise protocol sources under ios/PassportBridge are a Swift port
of the upstream Python modules in linux/src/musegadget/noise and keep the
upstream copyright notice. The root README and public
Passport documentation have been adapted for community distribution.

FoloToy BSP and related test stubs retain their MIT notices. Generated Source
Han Sans font resources retain SIL Open Font License 1.1. Other third-party
files and dependencies retain their own licenses and copyright notices.
